.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
infra/**/backend.hcl
crash.log
# Load-test outputs (milestone 4): raw k6/Prometheus/docker-stats files; the summary is in docs/load-test.md.
loadtest/results/
# graphify knowledge graph (local, rebuilt with `graphify update .`)
graphify-out/
